> What a character wearing speed boots who then is zapped with speed
> monster? I've seen the message "You speed up a bit more," so that should
> mean one is moving at 5/3 speed?

Player speed works Entirely Differently to monster speed. Your
possible speed modifiers are normal (always base speed), fast (2/3
chance of 150% speed each turn), and very fast (1/3 chance of 200%
speed, 2/3 chance of 150% speed each turn). "You speed up a bit more"
is actually the message for putting on speed boots while being fast,
not vice versa.

